/*Full rework*/

Incrementing die system
Players start with a die and when that die rolls the highest number it can they go up a die value and roll again keeping the highest die value rolled
as the new base die to roll. ex: A player rolls a brawl check, they have a d4 for the stat and roll a 4, they now roll a d6 and roll a 2. Add that value to the previous roll
that player now has a d6 for brawl

Everyone starts at a d4 for all stats
stats being //under work still

Brawl - Ability to hurt others physically
Hot - Ability to charm others
Sneak - Ability to operate without being seen
Stunts - Ability to physically evade damage
Tech - Ability to operate machinery
Tough - Ability to protect self from harm
Wit - Being smart

Stand creation rather than being the stand stats youll select a series of modifiers that will alter how your stand operates
starting with the base of: Long range Humanoid stand - range of 50 meters, no other modifiers

Modifiers:
Modifiers will affect the stands range, bonuses to rolls, and stand abilities
ex. Gain a +5 to all brawl checks involving your stand, reduce this stands range to 2 meters
